  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/63d7734362b4cfe7931b86dde8ae1106d9a32ef8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/63d7734362b4cfe7931b86dde8ae1106d9a32ef8\" data-origin-width=\"476\" data-origin-height=\"97\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>그리고 아래의 캡쳐 내용을 GPT에 붙여넣습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f036b292b577548d6137001932de6edff4430956\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f036b292b577548d6137001932de6edff4430956\" data-origin-width=\"348\" data-origin-height=\"646\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da1026788db433a35818161874576d482f335e51\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da1026788db433a35818161874576d482f335e51\" data-origin-width=\"701\" data-origin-height=\"499\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb351bf628a1575522b41455c3fb9ac9410aa9c8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb351bf628a1575522b41455c3fb9ac9410aa9c8\" data-origin-width=\"703\" data-origin-height=\"273\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1ef097ff66648c097faa2332fd0f3aa08ada4c3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1ef097ff66648c097faa2332fd0f3aa08ada4c3\" data-origin-width=\"710\" data-origin-height=\"735\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>위 내용을 활용하여&#160;<br>미리캔버스의 &#39;AI 프리젠테이션 만들기&#39;로&#160;<br>ppt 자료를 만들어봅니다.<br>&#160;<br>1. GPT가 작성해준 카드1~카드6을 복사합니다.<br>2. 미리캔버스 AI 프리젠테이션을 실행합니다.<br>3. 복사한 카드 내용을 &#39;자료 붙여넣기&#39; 를 합니다.&#160;<br>4. 템플릿을 고르고, 3분 정도 기다리면 완성!</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fed4af7db40b189ad829969bdf42aa0973e1ff6b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fed4af7db40b189ad829969bdf42aa0973e1ff6b\" data-origin-width=\"1095\" data-origin-height=\"613\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/21e3f7a76f0cc1ae4228d83b95600f75fdf8bebf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/21e3f7a76f0cc1ae4228d83b95600f75fdf8bebf\" data-origin-width=\"713\" data-origin-height=\"400\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/10ce4ca7f9cc3f89a82d068d01de4459cef18736\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/10ce4ca7f9cc3f89a82d068d01de4459cef18736\" data-origin-width=\"712\" data-origin-height=\"401\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a70642e991d